{"id":"928bcf665de24775","group":"16","path":"16/16-df-lambda-fibrations.md","title":"一阶、二阶与高阶多态纤维化","display":"df-lambda-fibrations — 一阶、二阶与高阶多态纤维化","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory","book_abbrev":"16","chapter":"1","label":"16-df-lambda-fibrations","aliases":["16-df-lambda-fibrations","Lambda fibrations"],"display":"df-lambda-fibrations — 一阶、二阶与高阶多态纤维化","depends_on":["[[16-df-polymorphic-fibration]]","[[16-df-generic-object]]","[[16-df-fibred-cartesian-closed]]","[[16-df-ccc-definition]]","[[16-df-simple-quantification]]","[[16-df-beck-chevalley]]","[[16-df-adjoint-functors]]"],"source":"Definitions 8.4.3–8.4.4, p. 473 (PDF 493); Definition 1.9.1, pp. 94–95 (PDF 114–115)","revision_date":"2026-10-20"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"16"},{"key":"chapter","html":"1"},{"key":"label","html":"16-df-lambda-fibrations"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>16-df-lambda-fibrations</span><span>Lambda fibrations</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-lambda-fibrations — 一阶、二阶与高阶多态纤维化"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"c8e5d73279cd6c19\" href=\"?note=c8e5d73279cd6c19\" title=\"16-df-polymorphic-fibration\">16-df-polymorphic-fibration</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"f600e95377e8cbf9\" href=\"?note=f600e95377e8cbf9\" title=\"16-df-generic-object\">16-df-generic-object</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"fe079ae5e294c97a\" href=\"?note=fe079ae5e294c97a\" title=\"16-df-fibred-cartesian-closed\">16-df-fibred-cartesian-closed</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"18a4c8ba03fadf06\" href=\"?note=18a4c8ba03fadf06\" title=\"16-df-ccc-definition\">16-df-ccc-definition</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"e39d17458a2b0aa4\" href=\"?note=e39d17458a2b0aa4\" title=\"16-df-simple-quantification\">16-df-simple-quantification</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"86e53aa076639692\" href=\"?note=86e53aa076639692\" title=\"16-df-beck-chevalley\">16-df-beck-chevalley</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"a88937ea87ff8530\" href=\"?note=a88937ea87ff8530\" title=\"16-df-adjoint-functors\">16-df-adjoint-functors</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"Definitions 8.4.3–8.4.4, p. 473 (PDF 493); Definition 1.9.1, pp. 94–95 (PDF 114–115)"},{"key":"revision_date","html":"2026-10-20"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B\">\\(p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B\\)</span> 为带提升选择的纤维化。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PolyFib}\">\\(\\mathrm{PolyFib}\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"c8e5d73279cd6c19\" href=\"?note=c8e5d73279cd6c19\" title=\"16-df-polymorphic-fibration\">16-df-polymorphic-fibration</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FibCCC}\">\\(\\mathrm{FibCCC}\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"fe079ae5e294c97a\" href=\"?note=fe079ae5e294c97a\" title=\"16-df-fibred-cartesian-closed\">16-df-fibred-cartesian-closed</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CCC}\">\\(\\mathrm{CCC}\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"18a4c8ba03fadf06\" href=\"?note=18a4c8ba03fadf06\" title=\"16-df-ccc-definition\">16-df-ccc-definition</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Generic}_p(G)\">\\(\\mathrm{Generic}_p(G)\\)</span> 采用基本多态纤维化明确引用的泛对象定义。</li>\n<li>在基底有限积存在的分支固定有限积；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I,J,K\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal B\">\\(I,J,K\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal B\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Omega\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal B\">\\(\\Omega\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal B\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u:K\\to I\">\\(u:K\\to I\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi_{I,J}:I\\times J\\to I\">\\(\\pi_{I,J}:I\\times J\\to I\\)</span>。下文 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S(u,J)\">\\(S(u,J)\\)</span> 是显式给出的积拉回方块。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SimpleProd},\\mathrm{SimpleCoprod}\">\\(\\mathrm{SimpleProd},\\mathrm{SimpleCoprod}\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"e39d17458a2b0aa4\" href=\"?note=e39d17458a2b0aa4\" title=\"16-df-simple-quantification\">16-df-simple-quantification</a>。带数据参数的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BC}_\\Pi(p;S;R&#39;,\\Phi&#39;,R,\\Phi)\">\\(\\mathrm{BC}_\\Pi(p;S;R&#39;,\\Phi&#39;,R,\\Phi)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BC}_\\Sigma(p;S;L&#39;,\\Phi&#39;,L,\\Phi)\">\\(\\mathrm{BC}_\\Sigma(p;S;L&#39;,\\Phi&#39;,L,\\Phi)\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"86e53aa076639692\" href=\"?note=86e53aa076639692\" title=\"16-df-beck-chevalley\">16-df-beck-chevalley</a>；各次调用的伴随函子与 Hom 双射均在下式显式传入。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{AdjHom}(F,G,\\Phi)\">\\(\\mathrm{AdjHom}(F,G,\\Phi)\\)</span> 及由 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Phi\">\\(\\Phi\\)</span> 产生的单位、余单位采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-13\" data-note=\"a88937ea87ff8530\" href=\"?note=a88937ea87ff8530\" title=\"16-df-adjoint-functors\">16-df-adjoint-functors</a>。</li>\n<li>下文 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Pi_{I,\\Omega},\\Sigma_{I,\\Omega}:\\mathcal E_{I\\times\\Omega}\\to\\mathcal E_I\">\\(\\Pi_{I,\\Omega},\\Sigma_{I,\\Omega}:\\mathcal E_{I\\times\\Omega}\\to\\mathcal E_I\\)</span> 为候选函子族。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SimpleOmegaProd},\\mathrm{SimpleOmegaCoprod},\\mathrm{FibExp},\\mathrm{LambdaToFib},\\mathrm{LambdaTwoFib},\\mathrm{LambdaOmegaFib}\">\\(\\mathrm{SimpleOmegaProd},\\mathrm{SimpleOmegaCoprod},\\mathrm{FibExp},\\mathrm{LambdaToFib},\\mathrm{LambdaTwoFib},\\mathrm{LambdaOmegaFib}\\)</span> 均在下文定义。末式只在已选 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SimpleOmegaProd}(p,\\Omega)\">\\(\\mathrm{SimpleOmegaProd}(p,\\Omega)\\)</span> 的见证伴随族上使用。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"S(u,J)\\coloneqq\n(u\\times\\operatorname{id}_J,\\pi_{K,J},\\pi_{I,J},u).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[S(u,J)\\coloneqq\n(u\\times\\operatorname{id}_J,\\pi_{K,J},\\pi_{I,J},u).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{SimpleOmegaCoprod}(p,\\Omega)\\Longleftrightarrow{}&amp;\n(\\exists(\\Sigma_{I,\\Omega},\\Phi^{\\Sigma,I})_{I\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal B})\\Bigl[\n(\\forall I\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal B)\\ \\mathrm{AdjHom}(\\Sigma_{I,\\Omega},\\pi_{I,\\Omega}^*,\\Phi^{\\Sigma,I})\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land(\\forall I,K\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal B)\n(\\forall u\\in\\mathcal B(K,I))\\ \\mathrm{BC}_\\Sigma(p;S(u,\\Omega);\\Sigma_{K,\\Omega},\\Phi^{\\Sigma,K},\\Sigma_{I,\\Omega},\\Phi^{\\Sigma,I})\\Bigr],\\\\\n\\mathrm{SimpleOmegaProd}(p,\\Omega)\\Longleftrightarrow{}&amp;\n(\\exists(\\Pi_{I,\\Omega},\\Phi^{\\Pi,I})_{I\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal B})\\Bigl[\n(\\forall I\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal B)\\ \\mathrm{AdjHom}(\\pi_{I,\\Omega}^*,\\Pi_{I,\\Omega},\\Phi^{\\Pi,I})\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land(\\forall I,K\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal B)\n(\\forall u\\in\\mathcal B(K,I))\\ \\mathrm{BC}_\\Pi(p;S(u,\\Omega);\\Pi_{K,\\Omega},\\Phi^{\\Pi,K},\\Pi_{I,\\Omega},\\Phi^{\\Pi,I})\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{SimpleOmegaCoprod}(p,\\Omega)\\Longleftrightarrow{}&amp;\n(\\exists(\\Sigma_{I,\\Omega},\\Phi^{\\Sigma,I})_{I\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal B})\\Bigl[\n(\\forall I\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal B)\\ \\mathrm{AdjHom}(\\Sigma_{I,\\Omega},\\pi_{I,\\Omega}^*,\\Phi^{\\Sigma,I})\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land(\\forall I,K\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal B)\n(\\forall u\\in\\mathcal B(K,I))\\ \\mathrm{BC}_\\Sigma(p;S(u,\\Omega);\\Sigma_{K,\\Omega},\\Phi^{\\Sigma,K},\\Sigma_{I,\\Omega},\\Phi^{\\Sigma,I})\\Bigr],\\\\\n\\mathrm{SimpleOmegaProd}(p,\\Omega)\\Longleftrightarrow{}&amp;\n(\\exists(\\Pi_{I,\\Omega},\\Phi^{\\Pi,I})_{I\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal B})\\Bigl[\n(\\forall I\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal B)\\ \\mathrm{AdjHom}(\\pi_{I,\\Omega}^*,\\Pi_{I,\\Omega},\\Phi^{\\Pi,I})\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land(\\forall I,K\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal B)\n(\\forall u\\in\\mathcal B(K,I))\\ \\mathrm{BC}_\\Pi(p;S(u,\\Omega);\\Pi_{K,\\Omega},\\Phi^{\\Pi,K},\\Pi_{I,\\Omega},\\Phi^{\\Pi,I})\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{FibExp}(p)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathrm{FibCCC}(p),\\\\\n\\mathrm{LambdaToFib}(p)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathrm{PolyFib}(p)\\land\\mathrm{FibExp}(p),\\\\\n\\mathrm{LambdaTwoFib}(p)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathrm{LambdaToFib}(p)\n\\land(\\exists G\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E)\\Bigl[\n\\mathrm{Generic}_p(G)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{7em}\\land\\mathrm{SimpleOmegaProd}(p,pG)\n\\land\\mathrm{SimpleOmegaCoprod}(p,pG)\\Bigr],\\\\\n\\mathrm{LambdaOmegaFib}(p)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathrm{LambdaToFib}(p)\n\\land\\mathrm{CCC}(\\mathcal B)\\land\\mathrm{SimpleProd}(p)\\land\\mathrm{SimpleCoprod}(p).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{FibExp}(p)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathrm{FibCCC}(p),\\\\\n\\mathrm{LambdaToFib}(p)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathrm{PolyFib}(p)\\land\\mathrm{FibExp}(p),\\\\\n\\mathrm{LambdaTwoFib}(p)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathrm{LambdaToFib}(p)\n\\land(\\exists G\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E)\\Bigl[\n\\mathrm{Generic}_p(G)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{7em}\\land\\mathrm{SimpleOmegaProd}(p,pG)\n\\land\\mathrm{SimpleOmegaCoprod}(p,pG)\\Bigr],\\\\\n\\mathrm{LambdaOmegaFib}(p)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathrm{LambdaToFib}(p)\n\\land\\mathrm{CCC}(\\mathcal B)\\land\\mathrm{SimpleProd}(p)\\land\\mathrm{SimpleCoprod}(p).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall_{\\Omega,I}\\coloneqq\\Pi_{I,\\Omega}:\n\\mathcal E_{I\\times\\Omega}\\to\\mathcal E_I.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall_{\\Omega,I}\\coloneqq\\Pi_{I,\\Omega}:\n\\mathcal E_{I\\times\\Omega}\\to\\mathcal E_I.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>三层均先具有 Definition 8.4.1 的多态语境结构。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda\\to\">\\(\\lambda\\to\\)</span> 增加纤维指数；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda2\">\\(\\lambda2\\)</span> 再沿泛对象基底 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Omega\">\\(\\Omega\\)</span> 量化；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda\\omega\">\\(\\lambda\\omega\\)</span> 沿任意种类量化，并要求基底有指数。这正是 Definition 8.4.3(i) 的三个分支。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FibExp}\">\\(\\mathrm{FibExp}\\)</span> 保留旧接口，但采用已展开的规范指数比较 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FibCCC}\">\\(\\mathrm{FibCCC}\\)</span>；单有对象间某个同构不足以保证重索引保持评价箭头。基本多态结构已经提供纤维有限积，因此这里的指数条件没有额外增加原书未要求的结构。</li>\n<li>简单 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Omega\">\\(\\Omega\\)</span> 积/余积是普通简单量词只取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"J=\\Omega\">\\(J=\\Omega\\)</span> 的限制；伴随和相应 BC 同时保留。方块顺序与 BC 定义一致：上边 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u\\times\\operatorname{id}_\\Omega\">\\(u\\times\\operatorname{id}_\\Omega\\)</span>，下边 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u\">\\(u\\)</span>，右边 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi_{I,\\Omega}\">\\(\\pi_{I,\\Omega}\\)</span>，左边 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi_{K,\\Omega}\">\\(\\pi_{K,\\Omega}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>每个 BC 条件显式接收该存在量词中的两个伴随分量及 Hom 双射；不再由自然语言约定把无数据参数的历史缩写绑定到局部见证。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall_{\\Omega,I}\">\\(\\forall_{\\Omega,I}\\)</span> 是所选右伴随的记号，不是基本 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PolyFib}\">\\(\\mathrm{PolyFib}\\)</span> 自动具备的量词。这里没有声称任一未配量词的多态纤维化都为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda2\">\\(\\lambda2\\)</span> 模型。</li>\n<li>来源：Definitions 8.4.3–8.4.4, p. 473（PDF 493）；简单量词及换基条件见 Definition 1.9.1, pp. 94–95（PDF 114–115）。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"16-df-polymorphic-fibration","status":"resolved","id":"c8e5d73279cd6c19","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-polymorphic-fibration]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-generic-object","status":"resolved","id":"f600e95377e8cbf9","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-generic-object]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-fibred-cartesian-closed","status":"resolved","id":"fe079ae5e294c97a","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-fibred-cartesian-closed]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-ccc-definition","status":"resolved","id":"18a4c8ba03fadf06","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-ccc-definition]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-simple-quantification","status":"resolved","id":"e39d17458a2b0aa4","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-simple-quantification]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-beck-chevalley","status":"resolved","id":"86e53aa076639692","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-beck-chevalley]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-adjoint-functors","status":"resolved","id":"a88937ea87ff8530","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-adjoint-functors]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-polymorphic-fibration","status":"resolved","id":"c8e5d73279cd6c19","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B$ 为带提升选择的纤维化。$\\mathrm{PolyFib}$ 采用 [[16-df-polymorphic-fibration]]，$\\mathrm{FibCCC}$ 采用 [[16-df-fibred-cartesian-closed]]，$\\mathrm{CCC}$ 采用 [[16-df-ccc-definition]]。$\\mathrm{Generic}_p(G)$ 采用基本多态纤维化明确引用的泛对象定义。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-fibred-cartesian-closed","status":"resolved","id":"fe079ae5e294c97a","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B$ 为带提升选择的纤维化。$\\mathrm{PolyFib}$ 采用 [[16-df-polymorphic-fibration]]，$\\mathrm{FibCCC}$ 采用 [[16-df-fibred-cartesian-closed]]，$\\mathrm{CCC}$ 采用 [[16-df-ccc-definition]]。$\\mathrm{Generic}_p(G)$ 采用基本多态纤维化明确引用的泛对象定义。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-ccc-definition","status":"resolved","id":"18a4c8ba03fadf06","anchor":"ref-10","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B$ 为带提升选择的纤维化。$\\mathrm{PolyFib}$ 采用 [[16-df-polymorphic-fibration]]，$\\mathrm{FibCCC}$ 采用 [[16-df-fibred-cartesian-closed]]，$\\mathrm{CCC}$ 采用 [[16-df-ccc-definition]]。$\\mathrm{Generic}_p(G)$ 采用基本多态纤维化明确引用的泛对象定义。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-simple-quantification","status":"resolved","id":"e39d17458a2b0aa4","anchor":"ref-11","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{SimpleProd},\\mathrm{SimpleCoprod}$ 采用 [[16-df-simple-quantification]]。带数据参数的 $\\mathrm{BC}_\\Pi(p;S;R',\\Phi',R,\\Phi)$、$\\mathrm{BC}_\\Sigma(